{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tvalue","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TValue"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TValue"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"header","children":[{"type":"text","value":"header"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../../index/type-aliases/Header.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Header"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TValue"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"contextdocument","children":[{"type":"text","value":"_contextDocument?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Document"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"code","value":"(event): void;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"parameters-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"event","children":[{"type":"text","value":"event"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"returns-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const onMouseDown = header_getResizeHandler(header)","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"function-header-getresizehandler","text":"Function: header_getResizeHandler()","level":1},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfeatures","text":"TFeatures","level":3},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"tvalue","text":"TValue","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"header","text":"header","level":3},{"id":"contextdocument","text":"_contextDocument?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"parameters-2","text":"Parameters","level":3},{"id":"event","text":"event","level":4},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":3},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Function: header\\_getResizeHandler()\n\n```ts\nfunction header_getResizeHandler<TFeatures, TData, TValue>(header, _contextDocument?): (event) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.utils.ts:91](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.utils.ts#L91)\n\nCreates the pointer/touch start handler for resizing a header.\n\nThe handler records starting sizes for all leaf headers, tracks drag deltas,\nwrites transient resize info, and commits column sizes on change or drag end\ndepending on `columnResizeMode`.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../../index/interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* [`RowData`](../../index/type-aliases/RowData.md)\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue` *extends* `unknown` = `unknown`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### header\n\n[`Header`](../../index/type-aliases/Header.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`, `TValue`\\>\n\n### \\_contextDocument?\n\n`Document`\n\n## Returns\n\n```ts\n(event): void;\n```\n\n### Parameters\n\n#### event\n\n`unknown`\n\n### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst onMouseDown = header_getResizeHandler(header)\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: header_getResizeHandler\ntitle: header_getResizeHandler\n---\n\n# Function: header\\_getResizeHandler()\n\n```ts\nfunction header_getResizeHandler<TFeatures, TData, TValue>(header, _contextDocument?): (event) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.utils.ts:91](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.utils.ts#L91)\n\nCreates the pointer/touch start handler for resizing a header.\n\nThe handler records starting sizes for all leaf headers, tracks drag deltas,\nwrites transient resize info, and commits column sizes on change or drag end\ndepending on `columnResizeMode`.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../../index/interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* [`RowData`](../../index/type-aliases/RowData.md)\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue` *extends* `unknown` = `unknown`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### header\n\n[`Header`](../../index/type-aliases/Header.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`, `TValue`\\>\n\n### \\_contextDocument?\n\n`Document`\n\n## Returns\n\n```ts\n(event): void;\n```\n\n### Parameters\n\n#### event\n\n`unknown`\n\n### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst onMouseDown = header_getResizeHandler(header)\n```\n"}
